  "slug": "linus-level",
  "name": "Linus Level",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Linus Level gives Claude Code a 1.0-10.0 engineering strictness dial, from fast creative prototyping to careful maintainer-grade production work. It calibrates autonomy, question-asking, verification, security posture, source-of-truth discipline, and when to stop before risky assumptions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `linus-level` (Set a 1.0-10.0 engineering working-mode dial - tunes agency, collaboration, assumption budget, decision ownership, questioning, verification, and security…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install linus-level@claude-community` from `rsoffer/linus-level-skill`.",
